ail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd985e1b/uploads/origins/7e28df85-fa74-4282-9c49-85feac2949fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e45c5b2d78d4ab026d1a2671a19f594", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd985e1b/uploads/origins/7e28df85-fa74-4282-9c49-85feac2949fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e45c5b2d78d4ab026d1a2671a19f594, https://si.imgix.net/bd985e1b/uploads/origins/7e28df85-fa74-4282-9c49-85feac2949fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b5fb510ae2b9a0ccf03e38c106eabe9c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd985e1b/uploads/origins/7e28df85-fa74-4282-9c49-85feac2949fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9040c3be0897f0ba72afe7de077368a3 3x"}, "body": "イラストがとても可愛いくて是非鈴鳴りりんを書いていただきたくリクエスト送らせていただきました。\n\n【リクエスト内容】\nクリスマス衣装でちょっと誘っている感じだと嬉しいです！表情差分はあれば嬉しいです！\n衣装やポーズはおまかせしますがちょっと衣装は布面積少なくても嬉しいです！\n\n\n【希望納品形式】\n※psdファイルでキャラクターと背景が分かれていたら幸いです。\nまた、頭の先、横の毛等、なるべくで大丈夫ですので先が切れないように描いていただけたら嬉しいです。\n\n【使用用途】\n・Vtuber活動(Twitter、配信サムネイル、short)収益済YouTubeでの活動も含む\n・FANBOXやメンバー様への壁紙配布\n・ネップリ使用\n\n【資料】\nｻｷｭﾊﾞｽｳﾞｧﾝﾊﾟｲｱ(髪色半分毛先赤色、ギザ歯、頭の羽と角) \n\n・ギザ歯のまつ毛の先に小さな蝙蝠の羽\n・元気でお調子者のメスガキ感\n・頭の角や羽は入り切らない場合ほんのり少し小さめ可です。\n・毛先が赤色入っております。\n\n\nお忙しい中恐縮ですがご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n鈴鳴りりん\n\n\nhttps://lit.link/SuzunarixRirin\n\nhttps://lit.link/SuzunarixRirin", "nc": 152, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@karachan_no_e/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2745832, "client_id": 2175659, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ebf62846151e5a1079561d6b9ee74e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ebf62846151e5a1079561d6b9ee74e9, https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=589ab9fe854daa1ad190a67613a124e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc7b57b0007700942c71c8e684f3a402 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=84c3f3fc8ed4adc3b53706fb76066c64", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=84c3f3fc8ed4adc3b53706fb76066c64, https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d859881ccbc5204c0dbdac7f4837ad1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7198f366/uploads/origins/3d58dce5-a2e6-474c-bed2-ee3911f8b708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=924918b8db0a3e08748cba98f38389fe 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I really like your art! I was wondering if you could draw an illustration for my character on the song 「残響散歌」 (Zankyou Sanka) by Aimer for Kimetsu no Yaiba: Yuukaku-hen Opening.  I would like it to have a softer touch to it's original intense atmosphere.\n\nI would leave everything up to you, including clothing's (preferably Japanese yukata/kimono), composition, facial expressions, poses etc as long as it fits the song. Do include fireworks as well and her fox mask and tail.  \n\nPlease draw this in 16:9 format as this would be used for streaming and for social media. Please do separate the character and background too. Do appeal if needed. I hope you could accept my request and thank you so much for reading. ^.^\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tk22VayBH7rMKRU3GdQDmwQB1eQltxlW?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@karachan_no_e/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2745832, "client_id": 1802270, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=092584b976fff62eace49053991cada9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=092584b976fff62eace49053991cada9, https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad8d3dacac040cc52b3f1c44f54ddc4b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7e33f5a1197278a0418c344d300cae6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1eb93e4ef1b91ac88334e399b0159406", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1eb93e4ef1b91ac88334e399b0159406, https://si.imgix.net/126c064c/uploads/origins/55e16e25-0136-4ee1-a45c-59ad36060c20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2C